{"unit_id":"1583477320__remote-dsh#card-zh","repo":"1583477320/remote-dsh","commit":"4d87c875bdbacd894f929fa548216e5e7d0ee199","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-panel-ssh 是一个 DSH 桌面侧栏插件，可通过 SSH 把远端 DeepSeek Harness 嵌入应用窗口。它在侧栏提供远程 DSH 面板，由宿主进程管理主机、建立 SSH 会话和本机回环网关，浏览器端以 iframe 显示远端网页。主要功能包括添加或复用 SSH 主机、测试连接环境、按需安装并启动远端 DSH、重载或放大会话面板，以及断开连接。适合需要在桌面 DSH 中访问远端 Linux 主机工作区的用户。需要可用的 SSH 主机与兼容版本的 Node.js；首次连接在远端缺少 DSH 时需 npm 访问包注册表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:107-180","lib/client.js:235-345","lib/index.js:41-190","lib/remote.js:68-223"]}
{"unit_id":"1583477320__remote-dsh#card-en","repo":"1583477320/remote-dsh","commit":"4d87c875bdbacd894f929fa548216e5e7d0ee199","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remote-panel-ssh embeds remote DSH in a desktop sidebar over SSH. It manages hosts and shows the remote UI through a local gateway. Users can test connections, prepare remote DSH, reload or enlarge the panel, and disconnect. Requires SSH and compatible Node.js; npm is needed for installation.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:107-180","lib/client.js:235-345","lib/index.js:41-190","lib/remote.js:68-223"]}
